---
layout: base.njk
navSection: categories
pagination:
  data: collections.postCategories
  size: 1
  alias: category
permalink: "/posts/{{ category.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ category.name }}"
  description: "Winter Wanderer의 {{ category.name }} 글 목록."
---
<main id="main" class="page posts-page">
  <div class="posts-intro"><p class="eyebrow">CATEGORY</p><h1>{{ category.name }}</h1><p>{% if category.slug == 'music' %}방장의 취향으로 고른 좋은 음악을 소개합니다.{% elif category.slug == 'game' %}게임에 관한 기록.{% else %}{{ category.name }}에 관한 기록.{% endif %}</p></div>
  <section class="posts-collection" aria-labelledby="category-posts-title">
    <div class="posts-collection-heading"><h2 id="category-posts-title">글 목록</h2><span>{{ category.posts.length }}</span></div>
    {% for topic in collections.postTopics %}{% if topic.parentSlug == category.slug %}<a class="topic-archive-link" href="/posts/{{ category.slug }}/{{ topic.slug }}/">{{ topic.name }} 글 모아보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <ol class="posts-list" aria-label="{{ category.name }} 글 목록">
      {% for post in category.posts %}<li><a href="{{ post.url }}"><div><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ol>
    {% if category.posts.length == 0 %}<p class="posts-empty">첫 음악 소개를 준비 중입니다.</p>{% endif %}
  </section>
</main>
